  "question": {
    "text": "The points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are",
