  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Midpoint of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Midpoint of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are the vertices of a parallelogram.<br />Now, the distance between <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><msqrt><mn>52</mn></msqrt></math> and the distance between <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mn>2</mn></math><br />Because <math><msqrt><mn>52</mn></msqrt><mo>≠</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, hence, points do not form a rectangle",
    "image": null
  },
